## Tasks

The `reward logger added` column uses `yes` / `no` tokens — `/harbor:rl-run` grep-parses this column and dispatches `/harbor:reward-add-log` automatically when a chosen task reads `no`. The `smoke` column reflects what `benchmark-generator` actually exercised; tasks that weren't in the smoke set show `not probed`.

